Package: brtps
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Regularized Thin Plate Splines for Spatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joaquin", "Cavieres", , "joaquin.cavieres@imng.uni-stuttgart.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Giovanni", "Tasso", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian spatial regression models in which the spatial
    random field is approximated with the regularized thin plate spline
    ('regTPS') construction of Cavieres and Krumscheid (2026)
    <doi:10.1007/s11222-026-10990-x>. Models are written in 'TMB' and
    posterior inference uses the sparse no-U-turn sampler of 'SparseNUTS'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/giovannitasso/brtps
BugReports: https://github.com/giovannitasso/brtps/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    TMB (>= 1.9.0)
LinkingTo:
    RcppEigen,
    TMB
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
